 "name_en": "Make-to-Stock Production with Variant Configuration (21D)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Make-to-Stock Production with Variant Configuration (21D)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item shows the Make-to-Stock Production with Variant Configuration in which Advanced Variant Configuration enables efficient state-of-the-art configuration for configurable products variants that reflect common definitions of a configurable material. The material variant is defined as a Bill of Material (BOM) where the components meet certain criteria. Initially, this material variant is produced and put into stock as later sales of it are anticipated by collection of Planned-Independent Requirements (PIRs). When a customer orders a fork lifter where the characteristics of the components meet those of the material variant, the fork lifter is taken directly from stock as production already happened based on PIRs. The sales price calculation is then based on the characteristics of the material variant. Since the material variant is available on stock, the fork lifter is directly delivered. The process finishes with the billing of the delivered fork lifter.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute Make-to-Stock production for material variants of the configurable product</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a customer sales order for a configured fork lifter resulting in a material variant</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate sales prices based on characteristics of the material variant</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process the delivery and billing for the customer</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve your company's sales and manufacturing performance with integrated Advanced Variant Configuration</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable your sales business process to handle frequently required variants that are represented as material variants in sales and manufacturing and show the configuration on the print-out</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Produce material variants upfront to incoming sales orders based on expected demand</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Deliver customer sales order processing for material variants immediately if stock is available from production</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>按库存生产（含变式配置）(21D)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目显示按库存生产（含变式配置），其中高级变式配置支持可配置产品变式的有效先进配置，反映可配置物料的通用定义。物料变式定义为组件满足特定条件的物料清单 (BOM)。最初，生产此物料变式并将其放入库存，因为通过收集计划独立需求 (PIR) 可以预计其后续销售。当客户订购组件特征满足物料变式的叉车时，直接从库存中取出升降式叉车，因为已基于 PIR 进行生产。然后，基于物料变式的特征计算销售价格。由于物料变式在库存中可用，因此直接交付升降式叉车。该流程以交付升降式叉车的开票结束。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">针对可配置产品的物料变式执行按库存生产。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为已配置的叉车创建客户销售订单，生成物料变式</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据物料变式的特征计算销售价格。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理交货并为客户开票</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod57a05c0caeb47a69db2e02f8f544cd7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过集成的高级变式配置，提高公司的销售和制造绩效</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使销售业务流程能够处理所需的变式，这些变式在销售和制造中表示为物料变式，并在打印件上显示配置</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据预期需求，提前生产新接销售订单的物料变式</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">如果生产中有可用库存，则立即为物料变式交付客户销售订单处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
